  "description": "Fixes two badly mistranslated conversations that change Twilight Princess's lore, plus a few smaller text mistakes. Also restores cut Ganondorf dialogue and lets you talk to the Twili in the Palace of Twilight again. Both restorations can be turned off in the Mods menu. Works with the Linkle Mod and other text mods.",
